flowchart TD
    START[Taker calls quote or swap]:::user --> LOCAL{Local λ check}

    LOCAL -->|amountOut < effective active| GAMMA{Shared Γ check}
    LOCAL -->|amountOut >= effective active| F1[ActiveLiquidityExceeded<br/>revert]:::risk

    GAMMA -->|remaining >= needed| COV{Coverage check}
    GAMMA -->|remaining < needed| F2[GroupActiveLiquidityExceeded<br/>revert]:::risk

    COV -->|coverage stable| DECAY[DECAY_XD + XYC_SWAP]:::swapvm
    COV -->|balance dropped| SHRINK_B[Scale quote down<br/>proportionally]:::warn
    COV -->|allowance dropped| SHRINK_A[Scale quote down<br/>proportionally]:::warn

    SHRINK_B --> RECHECK_B{Scaled output<br/>still viable?}
    SHRINK_A --> RECHECK_A{Scaled output<br/>still viable?}

    RECHECK_B -->|yes| DECAY
    RECHECK_B -->|no| F3[Effective reserve<br/>too small — revert]:::risk
    RECHECK_A -->|yes| DECAY
    RECHECK_A -->|no| F4[Effective reserve<br/>too small — revert]:::risk

    DECAY --> PRICING[XYC computes<br/>amountIn / amountOut]:::swapvm

    PRICING --> ISQUOTE{quote or swap?}
    ISQUOTE -->|quote| RETURN[Return amounts<br/>no state mutation]:::data
    ISQUOTE -->|swap| PERSIST[Persist local λ<br/>+ group Γ state]:::core

    PERSIST --> SETTLE[Aqua settlement<br/>safeTransferFrom]:::sponsor
    SETTLE --> SUCCESS[Transfer complete]:::core

    SETTLE -->|underfunded<br/>wallet fails| F5[ERC-20 transfer<br/>reverts — Aqua-level]:::risk

    classDef sponsor fill:#312e81,stroke:#818cf8,color:#ffffff,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef core fill:#064e3b,stroke:#34d399,color:#ffffff,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef swapvm fill:#065f46,stroke:#6ee7b7,color:#ffffff,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef risk fill:#7f1d1d,stroke:#f87171,color:#ffffff,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef data fill:#164e63,stroke:#22d3ee,color:#ffffff,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef user fill:#3f3f46,stroke:#d4d4d8,color:#ffffff,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef warn fill:#78350f,stroke:#fbbf24,color:#ffffff,stroke-width:2px;
